VERDICT: APPROVED_WITH_COMMENTS

The changed implementation correctly wires the draft-modal settings into PDF generation for both active route variants, supports merged and per-image output, and the configured Expo web workflow now uses the installed local CLI. TypeScript type-checking succeeds and the diff has no whitespace errors.

The repository lint command still fails (four existing lint errors, including in the changed tabs screen); the new settings code itself does not introduce a type-check failure. Resolve the lint errors before treating lint as a required CI gate.

Security: none observed.

Next actions: run the configured web workflow and manually exercise each setting combination, particularly merge-off output naming; clean the existing lint errors if the project requires a passing lint gate.

